    location is governed by a separate written placement agreement between Crossbell Vending and
    your business. Nothing on this site is an offer that binds either party until that agreement
    is signed, and if this site and a signed agreement ever differ, the agreement controls.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the site accurate and current, but product selection, machine
    specifications, service areas, and response commitments can change. Information on the site
    is provided for general guidance and may be updated without notice.
  </p>

  <h2>Using the contact forms</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to provide accurate information and to use the forms only for genuine inquiries
    and feedback. Do not submit content that is unlawful, abusive, or that you do not have the
    right to share. Automated or bulk submissions are not permitted.
  </p>

